ne imidic peptide bonds in oligopeptides (PubMed:16595688). Catalyzes prolyl peptide bond isomerization in CDC40/PRP17 (PubMed:33220177). Plays an important role in embryonic brain development; this function is independent of its isomerase activity (PubMed:33220177)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}